#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:72 35412e6e11284d889def679a40e433d8
msgid "Look through the GitHub issues. Issues tagged with `#feature` is open to whoever wants to implement it."
msgstr "查看 GitHub 上的问题。标有 ` #feature` 的问题对任何想实现它的人开放。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:75 ea6ea9a58f24486a9360494855124513
msgid "Improve Documentation"
msgstr "改进文档"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:77 d85a48dd1f00487ab435809b555efbc4
msgid ""
"DingoDB could always use better documentation, whether as part of the official docs or even on the web as blog posts or articles. See [Documentation]"
"(#documentation) for more details."
msgstr "DingoDB 需要更好的文档，无论是作为官方文档的一部分，还是作为博文或文章在网络上发布。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:81 8ed9ddc5f9ca45e3833a28b91ac40e46
msgid "Ask Questions"
msgstr "提问"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:83 b85d6326b7c448feb3c1233208fb801d
msgid "There is a dedicated on [Mailing list](mailto:dingodb@zetyun.com). Please use it when asking questions."
msgstr "在 [Mailing list](mailto:dingodb@zetyun.com) 上有专人负责解答您的问题。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:85 1edef7701ffb437b9db3112f8523824a
msgid "Pull Request Guidelines"
msgstr "拉取请求指南"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:87 f71633b092dd4f598e27ab1b161e7be3
msgid "A philosophy we would like to strongly encourage is"
msgstr "我们要大力提倡的理念是"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:89 d68d76d0fbf542378d50e5449426a595
msgid "Before creating a PR, create an issue."
msgstr "在创建 PR 之前，先创建一个问题。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:91 eeb03174d3f44ee7b5d594b77e245881
msgid "The purpose is to separate problem from possible solutions."
msgstr "目的是将问题与可能的解决方案区分开来。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:93 558ba077933542f4b62e78fb74921b87
msgid ""
"**Bug fixes:** If you’re only fixing a small bug, it’s fine to submit a pull request right away but we highly recommend to file an issue detailing what "
"you’re fixing. This is helpful in case we don’t accept that specific fix but want to keep track of the issue. Please keep in mind that the project "
"maintainers reserve the rights to accept or reject incoming PRs, so it is better to separate the issue and the code to fix it from each other. In some "
"cases, project maintainers may request you to create a separate issue from PR before proceeding."
msgstr ""
"**错误修复：** 如果您只是修复一个小错误，立即提交拉取请求即可，但我们强烈建议您提交一个问题，详细说明您要修复的问题。如果我们不接受该特定修复，但又想跟"
"踪该问题，这将很有帮助。请记住，项目维护者有权接受或拒绝收到的 PR，因此最好将问题和修复代码分开。在某些情况下，项目维护者可能会要求您在继续之前创建一个"
"独立于 PR 的问题。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:95 c18f9d2ea772471ba7b4979b2ea3c37e
msgid ""
"**Refactor:** For small refactors, it can be a standalone PR itself detailing what you are refactoring and why. If there are concerns, project "
"maintainers may request you to create a `#DIP` for the PR before proceeding."
msgstr "**重构：** 对于小规模的重构，可以是一个独立的 PR，详细说明重构的内容和原因。如果有疑虑，项目维护者可能会要求你在继续之前为 PR 创建一个 `#DIP`。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:97 b42abf8f30d449debc576a3beeeea349
msgid ""
"**Feature/Large changes:** If you intend to change the public API, or make any non-trivial changes to the implementation, we require you to file a new "
"issue as `#DIP` (DingoDB Improvement Proposal). This lets us reach an agreement on your proposal before you put significant effort into it. You are "
"welcome to submit a PR along with the DIP (sometimes necessary for demonstration), but we will not review/merge the code until the DIP is approved."
msgstr ""
"**功能/大改动：** 如果您打算更改公共 API，或者对实现进行任何非小规模的改动，我们要求您提交一个新的问题作为 `#DIP` (DingoDB Improvement Proposal)。这可以"
"让我们在您投入大量精力之前就您的提议达成一致。我们也欢迎您在提交 DIP 的同时提交 PR（有时是演示所必需的），但在 DIP 被批准之前，我们不会审核/合并代码。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:99 98679d024176408bab624fa11a948309
msgid ""
"In general, small PRs are always easier to review than large PRs. The best practice is to break your work into smaller independent PRs and refer to the "
"same issue. This will greatly reduce turnaround time."
msgstr "一般来说，小型公关总是比大型公关更容易审核。最好的做法是将您的工作分成较小的独立公关，并提及同一问题。这将大大缩短周转时间。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:101 daba7bcb43074bf1988962ce52a8c21c
msgid ""
"If you wish to share your work which is not ready to merge yet, create a [Draft PR](https://github.blog/2019-02-14-introducing-draft-pull-requests/). "
"This will enable maintainers and the CI runner to prioritize mature PR's."
msgstr ""
"如果您想分享尚未准备好合并的工作，请创建一个 [Draft PR](https://github.blog/2019-02-14-introducing-draft-pull-requests/)。这将有助于维护者和 CI 运行人员"
"优先处理成熟的 PR。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:103 23697757e64449aea3ac68f1a569013a
msgid ""
"Finally, never submit a PR that will put master branch in broken state. If the PR is part of multiple PRs to complete a large feature and cannot work "
"on its own, you can create a feature branch and merge all related PRs into the feature branch before creating a PR from feature branch to master."
msgstr ""
"最后，千万不要提交会使主分支处于崩溃状态的 PR。如果 PR 是为完成一个大型功能而提交的多个 PR 的一部分，且无法独立运行，那么可以创建一个功能分支，将所有相"
"关的 PR 合并到功能分支中，然后再创建从功能分支到主分支的 PR。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:105 043f02be79884f2ebaed9b34f031b8dc
msgid "Protocol"
msgstr "规程"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:107 951d60972ce641c28ce6f538a36c69c9
msgid "Authoring"
msgstr "编写"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:109 f6f823b507bc4d0b8c92a4481beeca86
msgid "Fill in all sections of the PR template."
msgstr "填写 PR 模板的所有部分。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:110 e05e5161ac5e4caca26683bd32351b77
msgid "Title the PR with one of the following semantic prefixes (inspired by [Karma](http://karma-runner.github.io/0.10/dev/git-commit-msg.html])):"
msgstr "用以下语义前缀之一为 PR 命题（受 [Karma](http://karma-runner.github.io/0.10/dev/git-commit-msg.html])启发）："

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:112 8f793aeb56e046bbba72853f89806820
msgid "`feat` (new feature)"
msgstr "`feat`（新功能）"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:113 ac335b4f49fa41caa5ec7635e67b44f7
msgid "`fix` (bug fix)"
msgstr "`fix` (错误修复)"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:114 9a959f0ba6984cde94440a5639637b7e
msgid "`docs` (changes to the documentation)"
msgstr "`文档`（对文档的修改）"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:115 45326d98299741c39dbe9f13822e943f
msgid "`style` (formatting, missing semi colons, etc; no application logic change)"
msgstr "`style`（格式化、缺少分号等；不改变应用程序逻辑）"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:116 72b70371849c469289a942d773f64930
msgid "`refactor` (refactoring code)"
msgstr "`refactor` (重构代码)"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:117 0176db5abde844fe80cfa3e841e7dfb5
msgid "`test` (adding missing tests, refactoring tests; no application logic change)"
msgstr "`test` （添加缺失的测试、重构测试；不改变应用程序逻辑）"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:118 12203d44a35243c5966644b65f2479a1
msgid "`chore` (updating tasks etc; no application logic change)"
msgstr "`chore` （更新任务等；不改变应用程序逻辑）"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:119 ee6a75b91d9c4f2380217cf0b243adeb
msgid "`perf` (performance-related change)"
msgstr "`perf` （与绩效有关的变化）"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:120 8eeea8ec4054442c9be953d5a846ca90
msgid "`build` (build tooling, Docker configuration change)"
msgstr "`build` （构建工具、Docker 配置更改）"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:121 7811f510b2524b6f8fef2967056a6ea7
msgid "`ci` (test runner, Github Actions workflow changes)"
msgstr "`ci` （测试运行器、Github 操作工作流程变更）"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:122 d199115e460240d4a4a126f0bd664c48
msgid "`other` (changes that don't correspond to the above -- should be rare!)"
msgstr "`other`（与上述内容不一致的更改 -- 应该很少见！）。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:123 5d0ffbd73dd048038b629b37fafe3e2c
msgid "Examples:"
msgstr "示例："

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:124 74c097cf081d407a9986f7e8488f5224
msgid "`feat: export charts as ZIP files`"
msgstr "特征：将图表导出为 ZIP 文件"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:125 83537c1cce574a7a999bf11e303a11a1
msgid "`perf(api): improve API info performance`"
msgstr "`perf(api): 提高应用程序接口信息的性能`"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:126 17fbf9ee92de45cc8e464629887d0e3f
msgid "`fix(chart-api): cached-indicator always shows value is cached`"
msgstr "修正(chart-api)：缓存指示器始终显示已缓存的值"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:128 606132dc73c54586920e0bd3babd00c7
msgid ""
"Add prefix `[WIP]` to title if not ready for review (WIP = work-in-progress). We recommend creating a PR with `[WIP]` first and remove it once you have "
"passed CI test and read through your code changes at least once."
msgstr ""
"如果尚未准备好接受审核，请在标题中添加前缀 `[WIP]`（WIP = 进行中的工作）。我们建议先创建 PR，并在通过 CI 测试并至少通读一次代码更改后删除前缀`[WIP]`。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:129 854e994c1dfb409e8f574f109dca8291
msgid ""
"If you believe your PR contributes a potentially breaking change, put a `!` after the semantic prefix but before the colon in the PR title, like so: "
"`feat!: Added foo functionality to bar`"
msgstr "如果您认为您的 PR 有可能带来破坏性改动，请在语义前缀之后、PR 标题的冒号之前加上 `！`，就像这样： feat！：为 bar 添加 foo 功能"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:130 6254ad64962b4f41ba1da2cec836c80a
msgid "**Screenshots/GIFs:** Changes to user interface require before/after screenshots, or GIF for interactions"
msgstr "**屏幕截图/GIF：** 更改用户界面需要截图前/后，或 GIF 进行交互"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:131 27e38f89d7db4fb8824f01f605397f18
msgid ""
"Recommended capture tools ([Kap](https://getkap.co/), [LICEcap](https://www.cockos.com/licecap/), [Skitch](https://download.cnet.com/Skitch/"
"3000-13455_4-189876.html))"
msgstr ""
"推荐的捕捉工具（[Kap](https://getkap.co/)、[LICEcap](https://www.cockos.com/licecap/)、[Skitch](https://download.cnet.com/Skitch/"
"3000-13455_4-189876.html)）"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:132 39927c45a3ca467b80f0a10c08e2b813
msgid "If no screenshot is provided, the committers will mark the PR with `need:screenshot` label and will not review until screenshot is provided."
msgstr "如果没有提供截图，提交者会在 PR 上标注 `need:screenshot`（需要截图）标签，在提供截图之前不会进行审核。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:133 f9f4cd98b1944913a919aa1d1f67ff49
msgid "**Dependencies:** Be careful about adding new dependency and avoid unnecessary dependencies."
msgstr "**依赖关系：** 添加新的依赖关系时要小心谨慎，避免不必要的依赖关系。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:134 8501c25365004607828b007c2c6cd622
msgid "**Tests:** The pull request should include tests, either as doctests, unit tests, or both. Make sure to resolve all errors and test failures."
msgstr "**测试：** 拉取请求应包括测试，可以是 doctests、单元测试，或两者兼而有之。确保解决所有错误和测试失败。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:135 b4ad5e572cdd4788a403defa7bab51e4
msgid "**Documentation:** If the pull request adds functionality, the docs should be updated as part of the same PR."
msgstr "**文档：** 如果拉取请求增加了功能，文档应作为同一 PR 的一部分进行更新。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:136 47cd156f5f494d689516a87dbdf383f1
msgid ""
"**CI:** Reviewers will not review the code until all CI tests are passed. Sometimes there can be flaky tests. You can close and open PR to re-run CI "
"test. Please report if the issue persists. After the CI fix has been deployed to `master`, please rebase your PR."
msgstr ""
"**CI：** 审核人员在所有 CI 测试通过之前不会审核代码。有时，测试可能会出现问题。您可以关闭并打开 PR 以重新运行 CI 测试。如果问题仍然存在，请报告。在 CI "
"修复被部署到 “master ”后，请重置您的 PR。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:137 50ac150794694e3d8904f2985fb1b81e
msgid "**Code coverage:** Please ensure that code coverage does not decrease."
msgstr "**代码覆盖率：** 请确保代码覆盖率不降低。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:138 91a8f32411994dd4a78af81ecd7648a9
msgid ""
"Remove `[WIP]` when ready for review. Please note that it may be merged soon after approved so please make sure the PR is ready to merge and do not "
"expect more time for post-approval edits."
msgstr "准备就绪后，删除 `[WIP]`。请注意，批准后可能很快就会合并，因此请确保 PR 已准备好合并，且不要期望有更多时间进行批准后的编辑。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:139 62eba48ff14c4eb3b643a08d84869ba9
msgid "If the PR was not ready for review and inactive for > 30 days, we will close it due to inactivity. The author is welcome to re-open and update."
msgstr "如果 PR 尚未准备好接受审核，且静止时间超过 30 天，我们将以静止为由关闭 PR。欢迎作者重新打开并更新。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:141 38c3169928c2446da256aeecdcd32660
msgid "Reviewing"
msgstr "检查"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:143 94a056dc738a4e3da26ceca821d7458b
msgid "Use constructive tone when writing reviews."
msgstr "在撰写评论时使用建设性的语气。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:144 bc61759f29c341a982cbef6f42b7dabf
msgid "If there are changes required, state clearly what needs to be done before the PR can be approved."
msgstr "如果需要修改，应明确说明在批准 PR 之前需要做哪些工作。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:145 a9f8b98f1a2842409e41c611af5bbb1b
msgid "If you are asked to update your pull request with some changes there's no need to create a new one. Push your changes to the same branch."
msgstr "如果您被要求更新您的拉取请求，并做出一些修改，您无需创建一个新的拉取请求。将您的更改推送到同一分支即可。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:146 94bfabd8ce8c4fffb8f17f084fe98d44
msgid "The committers reserve the right to reject any PR and in some cases may request the author to file an issue."
msgstr "提交者保留拒绝任何 PR 的权利，在某些情况下可能会要求作者提交问题。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:148 339ab78ff32e4109ae302d0d55eb151c
msgid "Merging"
msgstr "合并"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:150 16679440d187455b86d30dbd5f5f9f92
msgid "At least one approval is required for merging a PR."
msgstr "合并 PR 至少需要一个批准。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:151 da42ebbb28c5498e830d996b637b11fa
msgid "PR is usually left open for at least 24 hours before merging."
msgstr "在合并前，PR 通常至少要开放 24 小时。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:152 3524c1ba57814d82a46704ad8a50ba39
msgid "After the PR is merged, [close the corresponding issue(s)](https://help.github.com/articles/closing-issues-using-keywords/)."
msgstr "合并 PR 后，[关闭相应的问题](https://help.github.com/articles/closing-issues-using-keywords/)。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:154 979c226227c24904bfd9afbb29477d6b
msgid "Post-merge Responsibility"
msgstr "合并后的任务"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:156 cee63d28d0c04f7aa5882fd6df568c3e
msgid "Project maintainers may contact the PR author if new issues are introduced by the PR."
msgstr "如果 PR 引发了新问题，项目维护者可以联系 PR 作者。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:157 f8af699832a349159a4fef84c9a31f3e
msgid "Project maintainers may revert your changes if a critical issue is found, such as breaking master branch CI."
msgstr "如果发现关键问题，如破坏主分支 CI，项目维护人员可能会还原你的更改。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:159 7366f983a3de4eb8a2f09464ce5ef6d1
msgid "Managing Issues and PRs"
msgstr "管理问题和 PR"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:161 b787f37232294886a8acf843ab06aa07
msgid ""
"To handle issues and PRs that are coming in, committers read issues/PRs and flag them with labels to categorize and help contributors spot where to "
"take actions, as contributors usually have different expertises."
msgstr "为了处理收到的问题和 PR，提交者会阅读问题/PR，并用标签对其进行标记，以进行分类并帮助贡献者发现应采取的行动，因为贡献者通常具有不同的专业知识。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:163 cc18091ba32d46fd91119e72c70d5c24
msgid "Triaging goals"
msgstr "分流目标"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:165 2c89b99c526740d38c70110f78368a86
msgid "**For issues:** Categorize, screen issues, flag required actions from authors."
msgstr "**针对问题：** 对问题进行分类、筛选，标记作者需要采取的行动。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:166 5295a996a6e1477fb0127018674174b4
msgid "**For PRs:** Categorize, flag required actions from authors. If PR is ready for review, flag required actions from reviewers."
msgstr "**对于 PR：** 进行分类，标记作者需要采取的行动。如果 PR 已准备好接受审核，则标记审核人员的必要操作。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:168 eed17d3f179f4916b1f425b52cf7d531
msgid ""
"First, add **Category labels (a.k.a. hash labels)**. Every issue/PR must have one hash label (except spam entry). Labels that begin with `#` defines "
"issue/PR type:"
msgstr "首先，添加**类别标签（又称哈希标签）**。每个问题/PR 必须有一个哈希标签（垃圾邮件条目除外）。以 `#` 开头的标签定义了问题/PR 类型："

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md dfd57744fbd24eca9d924520e79bc22d
msgid "Label"
msgstr "标签"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md 17abbbd0e4774e99a42208dcb15667e8
msgid "for Issue"
msgstr "供发布"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md acb36104e4544ea583ec87058d7492db
msgid "for PR"
msgstr "供提交 PR"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md 0aba54c710e844afb54b78bd73accef2
msgid "`#bug`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md 7e0f8fe6b0944daea3efde4fadfb164a
msgid "Bug report"
msgstr "错误报告"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md 5a3ed6f6f93e4d639606529356de13d6
msgid "Bug fix"
msgstr "错误修复"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md 77c283d42a6343a59db893f1a5c14706
msgid "`#code-quality`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md dc216fb026ab4c4288988ba708428554
msgid "Describe problem with code, architecture or productivity"
msgstr "描述代码、架构或效率方面的问题"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md 110b243bce524f79b724d6cec8eeddaa
msgid "Refactor, tests, tooling"
msgstr "重构、测试、工具"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md b54872ff89d5497dbd1b74cfd3b55f06
msgid "`#feature`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md 44f93243b5344bc29e862cba0b1d1f9e
msgid "New feature request"
msgstr "新功能请求"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md 56c83496853f4a6d811591f5aef48e2e
msgid "New feature implementation"
msgstr "新功能的实施"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md e04a7468603d4295a59a9c9bbabb5851
msgid "`#refine`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md 1e1f994c7f6345dab6e0b2463c16a69b
msgid "Propose improvement that does not provide new features and is also not a bug fix nor refactor, such as adjust padding, refine UI style."
msgstr "提出不提供新功能，也不是错误修复或重构的改进建议，如调整 padding、改进 UI 风格。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md 8656c9e513a64d2babf4e854ebc39dee
msgid "Implementation of improvement that does not provide new features and is also not a bug fix nor refactor, such as adjust padding, refine UI style."
msgstr "实施不提供新功能的改进，也不是错误修复或重构，如调整填充、改进用户界面风格。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md c16d9bd5fde040c49dc3dea488cccf67
msgid "`#doc`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md e560afd63292446cbe5489ceb8234b83 fa7e89eeb275467e8ee9f7aa50b84d79
msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "文档"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md c4c0bcf27f06460c9006f0a1805eabaa
msgid "`#question`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md 3f487a3a2c5b4d729366e20524648199
msgid "Troubleshooting: Installation, Running locally, Ask how to do something. Can be changed to `#bug` later."
msgstr "故障排除： 安装、本地运行、询问如何操作。稍后可改为 `#bug`。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md 0ab39d9dbc4b43849df307a8c2192213
msgid "N/A"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md 64f392f3dccd4ea39880379a5702d434
msgid "`#DIP`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md f854fcfb9f17484b8bdf8f1a3a16dce1
msgid "DingoDB Improvement Proposal"
msgstr "DingoDB 改进建议"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:180 fb9b7d0895ba41f49dc9eb38e1980407
msgid "Then add other types of labels as appropriate."
msgstr "然后酌情添加其他类型的标签。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:182 e2e42bd2a143446e97b7e310eba4ecf9
msgid ""
"**Need labels:** These labels have pattern `need:xxx`, which describe the work required to progress, such as `need:rebase`, `need:update`, "
"`need:screenshot`."
msgstr "**需求标签：** 这些标签的模式为 `need:xxx`，描述了进展所需的工作，如 `need:rebase`、`need:update`、`need:screenshot`。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:183 a2760e5ae6f14d0d96a1acaca47ed0f2
msgid ""
"**Risk labels:** These labels have pattern `risk:xxx`, which describe the potential risk on adopting the work, such as `risk:db-migration`. The "
"intention was to better understand the impact and create awareness for PRs that need more rigorous testing."
msgstr ""
"**风险标签：** 这些标签的模式为 “risk:xxx”，描述了采用该工作的潜在风险，如 “risk:db-migration”。这样做的目的是为了更好地了解影响，并为需要更严格测试的 "
"PR 创建意识。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:184 72fdee46795a421db78d22e60075f0b7
msgid ""
"**Status labels:** These labels describe the status (`abandoned`, `wontfix`, `cant-reproduce`, etc.) Issue/PRs that are rejected or closed without "
"completion should have one or more status labels."
msgstr "**状态标签：** 这些标签描述了状态（“放弃”、“不想修复”、“可以重新生成 ”等）。被拒绝或未完成就关闭的问题/PR 应具有一个或多个状态标签。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:185 fd18e0ec4c5d470b9be85653d02826a5
msgid ""
"**Version labels:** These have the pattern `vx.x` such as `v0.28`. Version labels on issues describe the version the bug was reported on. Version "
"labels on PR describe the first release that will include the PR."
msgstr "**版本标签：** 这些标签的模式为 `vx.x`，如 `v0.28`。问题上的版本标签描述了错误报告的版本。PR 上的版本标签描述的是包含 PR 的第一个版本。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:187 178bcbfb29d8400798e58d98a3e451c1
msgid "Committers may also update title to reflect the issue/PR content if the author-provided title is not descriptive enough."
msgstr "如果作者提供的标题描述性不够，提交者也可以更新标题以反映问题/PR 的内容。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:189 e752cfef0d3f45248b46cc2f90e0c1c9
msgid "If the PR passes CI tests and does not have any `need:` labels, it is ready for review, add label `review` and/or `design-review`."
msgstr "如果 PR 通过了 CI 测试，且没有任何 “need: ”标签，则可以进行审核，添加标签 “review ”和/或 “design-review”。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:191 19abfa2e9a194b68a5522d0545de2d0c
msgid "If an issue/PR has been inactive for >=30 days, it will be closed. If it does not have any status label, add `inactive`."
msgstr "如果某个问题/PR 在 >=30 天内一直处于非活动状态，则会被关闭。如果没有任何状态标签，则添加 “未激活”。"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:193 f1758852890e48d38305b52c3058f84c
msgid "Setup Local Environment for Development"
msgstr "设置本地开发环境"

#: ../../source/contributing/contributing.md:195 b9daaf445e5845169346dbed75aea7fd
msgid ""
"First, [fork the repository on GitHub](https://help.github.com/articles/about-forks/), then clone it. You can clone the main repository directly, but "
"you won't be able to send pull requests."
msgstr "首先，[fork GitHub 上的仓库](https://help.github.com/articles/about-forks/)，然后克隆它。你可以直接克隆主仓库，但不能发送拉取请求。"
